  "notes": [
    "The three pinned cores expose the same call topology for update_option(name, value, true), including update_option's absent-row delegation into add_option.",
    "wp_default_autoload_value and wp_max_autoloaded_option_size are present in core but unreachable because TEC passes explicit autoload=true.",
    "The stock cache.php and class-wp-object-cache.php bytes are identical across all three pins and expose no callback hook around wp_cache_get/set/delete; external object-cache drop-ins are refused before invocation.",
    "The exact TEC 6.17.2 and 6.17.3 Controller, Generator, Dropdown Provider, and Tribe__Cache bytes are identical; Tribe__Cache::delete delegates directly to the stock wp_cache_delete path."
  ]
